  "description": "The act of using digital communication to bully a person, typically by sending messages of an intimidating or harmful nature. The meme's intent to ridicule the subjects based on their appearance and social status, framed as 'trashy', constitutes a form of cyberbullying, as it attacks individuals through online or public media platforms, potentially causing emotional harm.",
